{"3741250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One Step Further", "steam_appid": 3741250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a directionless man who left everything behind to climb a Mountain and find his life's purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful! Every step is precise, keep your balance like a drunk and rethink your steps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing can be a challenge if you are not careful and patient!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHEN THE SKY FADES, MELODIES SOFTLY EMERGE GUIDING YOUR STEPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT PURPOSE YOU ARE LOOKING FOR IN LIFE?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCING</strong>: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based climbing and walking, with a focus on realistic balance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character balance mechanics — keep our (slightly tipsy) adventurer on his feet! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycle, with real-time transitions accompanied by soothing soundtracks at each sunrise and sunset. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent use of legs and arms — coordination is everything here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GUARDIAN BEAST OF THE MOUNTAIN AWAITS YOU!!!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a directionless man who left everything behind to climb a Mountain and find his life's purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful! Every step is precise, keep your balance like a drunk and rethink your steps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climbing can be a challenge if you are not careful and patient!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHEN THE SKY FADES, MELODIES SOFTLY EMERGE GUIDING YOUR STEPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/1aa4d3b6d4f35de105056abf575971a7.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT PURPOSE YOU ARE LOOKING FOR IN LIFE?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/7aaed5a89c8d4337edb0fa827bbd971d.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCING</strong>: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based climbing and walking, with a focus on realistic balance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character balance mechanics — keep our (slightly tipsy) adventurer on his feet! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycle, with real-time transitions accompanied by soothing soundtracks at each sunrise and sunset. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent use of legs and arms — coordination is everything here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GUARDIAN BEAST OF THE MOUNTAIN AWAITS YOU!!!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.poster.avif?t=1752594266\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.webm?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/01672c8366036447727442b7ee007bed.mp4?t=1752594266\" type=\"video/mp4